      "content": "Small, reddish-brown flower bud of the tropical evergreen tree Syzygium aromaticum. It yields oil which is used as an antiseptic and a flavoring, and is dried and ground into an aromatic spice. The ground flower is also used as a means of organic pest control. [Source: Getty AAT]"
    }
